    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**定理21. 平面内的一条直线垂直于平面的斜线的充分****和必要条件是这条直线垂直于斜****线的射影.**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 114,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0121#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "证明. 我们研究下列三条直线：$(AC)$是平面$\\alpha$的垂线，$(AB)$ 是斜线，$(CB)$是斜线在平面$\\alpha$上的射影(图131).",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 114,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0121#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-131",
      "label": "图 131",
      "printed_page": 114,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0121#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 131",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 131",
      "printed_page": 114,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0121#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "充分性. 设直线$m$在平面$\\alpha$内且垂直于$(CB)$. 这样，直线$m$垂直于平面$ABC$内的直线$(CB)$和$(AC)$.于是，$m\\perp(ABC)$(§28，定理14)，因此$m\\perp(AB)$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 114,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0121#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "必要性. 设$m\\subset\\alpha$，$m\\perp(AB)$. 因为还有$(AC)\\perp m$，所以$m\\perp(ABC)$，因此，$m\\perp(CB)$. $\\blacksquare$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 114,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0121#8"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
